[00:00.000] 作词 : Wendy Eisenberg
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Wendy Eisenberg
[00:27.248] Only a month ago, all of the habits of my old life died
[00:34.946] Sounds so extreme, but it is not a lie
[00:38.905] All is new
[00:43.211] Everything
[00:44.856]
[00:54.359] Old interlocutors came by to rid me of their points of view
[01:02.108] Their hidden messages could not get through anymore
[01:10.201] Not as clearly
[01:12.808]
[01:37.003] I had thought that
[01:44.709] They knew me better than I could know myself
[01:52.426] Not true
[01:56.204] Because they were not me, I thought that they could reveal me to me
[02:12.103] And I to them
[02:15.609] What gave me that idea?
[02:21.002]
[02:46.603] I asked The Ultraworld how it revealed itself to willing ears
[02:54.330] How did it take the form it would appear
[02:58.145] To us in
[03:02.454] Somewhat clearly?
[03:04.808]
[03:13.672] Dumbstruck and party to all of the virtues of my life I find
[03:21.359] Their hidden messages have been revised
[03:25.347] Where was I when that happened?
[03:32.105]
[03:56.185] The world answered
[04:03.937] "I know you better because it's not about knowledge"
[04:15.637] What does it mean that I am floored by the human ability
[04:31.453] To build structures larger than ourselves?
